't exist, fail loudly with `unknown ref: <X>` and exit non-zero before spawning agents — no silent fallback to default.\n\n2. **Fallback chain order**: keep current order (`origin/main → origin/master → main → master`), drop `origin/HEAD` from the head of the chain since it's almost always a symbolic ref to `origin/main` — redundant. Or keep `origin/HEAD` for forks where it points elsewhere?\n\n3. **Banner**: existing format `Reviewing <branch> vs <base>: N commits, M files changed, K uncommitted` works as-is — it already shows what was picked, so users can sanity-check. Optional: when `--base` was passed, prefix with `(--base override)` so the user knows their flag was respected.\n\n4. **Empty repo / detached HEAD / no fallback ref exists**: error out with actionable message (`no mainline branch found; pass --base <ref> to specify`), don't crash.\n\nSound right? If yes, I'll write up the design doc, run it through spec review, then move to implementation. If you want to adjust any of these (e.g., the flag name, the fallback chain order, the banner wording), let me know now."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1103,"cache_read_input_tokens":467991,"output_tokens":2817,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1103,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":2817,"cache_read_input_tokens":467991,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1103,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1103},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaqpXeQ3x3MyevGwce2ki","type":"assistant","uuid":"e0f8013e-1c53-4a6d-9eb4-645797e968fb","timestamp":"2026-05-08T21:35:36.490Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli","sessionId":"802b09ab-4617-4518-90